kernel bug. More infomation attached. I can gather more infomation if
you want :)

BTW, I used kexec to restart.
kexec -l /boot/vmlinuz-2.6.39.2 --append="ro root=/dev/sda1
rootfstype=ext4 quiet"
kexec -e

